-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p>The DeepCool FK120 High-Performance 120mm PWM Casing Cooling Fan is engineered to deliver exceptional cooling performance while maintaining a quiet operation. It's an ideal choice for enhancing airflow in your PC case, radiator, or CPU cooler.</p><h3>Key Specifications</h3><ul><li>Fan Speed: 500–1850 RPM ±10%</li><li>Airflow: 68.99 CFM</li><li>Static Pressure: 2.19 mmAq</li><li>Noise Level: ≤28 dB(A)</li><li>Bearing Type: Fluid Dynamic Bearing</li><li>Connector: 4-pin PWM</li><li>Rated Voltage: 12 VDC</li><li>Rated Current: 0.12 A</li><li>Power Consumption: 1.44 W</li><li>Dimensions: 120×120×25 mm</li><li>Weight: 170 g</li><li>Material: Polybutylene Terephthalate (PBT)</li></ul><h3>Features &amp; Performance</h3><ul><li>Elite Cooling Efficiency: The FK120 operates within a dynamic PWM range of 500 to 1850 RPM, providing a balance between high airflow and low noise levels.</li><li>Enhanced Static Pressure: With a maximum static pressure of 2.19 mmAq, it's effective in pushing air through dense heatsinks and radiators.</li><li>Quiet Operation: At full load, the fan maintains a noise level of ≤28 dB(A), ensuring a quiet computing environment.</li><li>Durable Construction: Made from high-quality PBT material, the FK120 offers increased durability and wear resistance.</li><li>Vibration Reduction: Shock-absorbing rubber pads at the screw mounts help reduce unnecessary vibrations for stable operation.​</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n    